  "item_short_desc": "<p>Elevate your wardrobe with Rothco's Women's Long Length Camo V-Neck T-Shirt. Crafted from a cozy blend of 60% cotton and 40% polyester, this camo shirt offers unparalleled comfort for everyday wear. Its longer length design provides extended coverage, making it versatile for various styling options. Enjoy an irritation-free experience with the tag-less label, ensuring maximum all-day comfort. The stylish V-neck adds a fashionable touch to your ensemble, making it suitable for both casual outings and outdoor activities.</p>",
