  "description": "<p>Elevate your wardrobe with Rothco's Women's Long Length Camo V-Neck T-Shirt. Crafted from a cozy blend of 60% cotton and 40% polyester, this camo shirt offers unparalleled comfort for everyday wear. Its longer length design provides extended coverage, making it versatile for various styling options. Enjoy an irritation-free experience with the tag-less label, ensuring maximum all-day comfort. The stylish V-neck adds a fashionable touch to your ensemble, making it suitable for both casual outings and outdoor activities. Whether you're running errands or spending a day outdoors, this camo V-neck tee offers both comfort and style. With its breathable fabric and flattering silhouette, this shirt is a wardrobe essential. Its longer length design allows for easy pairing with leggings or jeans, while the camo print adds a trendy twist to your look. Perfect for screen-printing, this V-neck tee offers endless customization possibilities. Add your own unique designs or logos to create personalized apparel that reflects your individual style. Whether you're looking for a versatile everyday shirt or a canvas for your creative expression, Rothco's Women's Long Length Camo V-Neck T-Shirt is the perfect choice. Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
